OL,3,ARayner defends pause to local council
OL,4,Aoverhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Rayner has defended her decision
OL,7,Fto pause plans to redraw local council
OL,8,Fboundaries, saying she wanted to ensure
OL,9,Fthey would survive legal challenge.
OL,11,FThe local government secretary also
OL,12,Ftold the BBC she wanted to be
OL,13,F"clear-eyed" about what the planned
OL,14,Fshake-up in 16 areas of England was
OL,15,Flikely to achieve.
OL,17,FIt comes after earlier this week she
OL,18,Fabandoned proposals in four other
OL,19,Fareas, in the face of legal threats
OL,20,Ffrom Reform and Conservative-led
OL,21,Fauthorities.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
