OL,3,AHong Kong's Tiananmen activists
OL,4,Asentenced to up to seven years in
OL,5,Aprison
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor years, Hong Kong was one of the
OL,8,Fonly places in Chinese territory where
OL,9,Fpeople could hold gatherings to mark
OL,10,Fthe Tiananmen Square crackdown - a
OL,11,Ftopic that is highly sensitive and
OL,12,Fheavily censored in mainland China.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
